<title>USA: IPO PRICING-TTI Team said priced at $6.25.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-TTI Team said priced at $6.25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>TTI Team Telecom International Ltd's initial public offering of 2.5 million shares was priced at $6.25 per share, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The estimated pricing range was $7 to $9 each. The shares are due to begin trading later today.</p>
<p>The Israeli company develops modular integrated software products and services for operation support and network management systems.</p>
</text>
